{"route":{"id":"39208","name":"Ruta Tot Mataró","intro":"La ruta Tot Mataró és una proposta de longitud considerable que ens porta a recórrer el perímetre del terme municipal de la ciutat i que ens permetrà gaudir del paisatge del municipi des de diferents perspectives. De la ruta destaquem la <strong>franja del litoral, Sant Martí i Sant Miquel de Mata</strong> i les àmplies i <strong>atractives vistes des de Can Bruguera.</strong> <strong>ATENCIÓ: Es tracta d'una ruta llarga i exigent. Trobareu avisos de les possibles dreceres a l'app.</strong>","tipus":"Circular antihorari","dificultat":"Difícil","durada":"7 hores 15 minuts","desnivell":"503.00 meters","distancia":"21.70 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Paisatgístic, Platges i cales","imgs":["n39208_1.jpg","n39208_2.jpg","n39208_3.jpg","n39208_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme/rutes-senderisme-mataro/ruta-tot-mataro","track":[[41.53371,2.44582],[41.53385,2.44599],[41.53397,2.44621],[41.53405,2.44643],[41.53416,2.44657],[41.53427,2.44673],[41.53435,2.44691],[41.53422,2.44705],[41.53408,2.4474],[41.53424,2.44761],[41.53439,2.44776],[41.53442,2.448],[41.53467,2.44818],[41.53486,2.44835],[41.53504,2.44853],[41.5352,2.44876],[41.53537,2.44898],[41.53548,2.44924],[41.53553,2.44947],[41.53561,2.44961],[41.53578,2.44977],[41.53597,2.44989],[41.53613,2.45013],[41.53629,2.45037],[41.53642,2.45055],[41.53658,2.45079],[41.53674,2.45103],[41.5369,2.45126],[41.53703,2.45145],[41.53717,2.45163],[41.53734,2.4519],[41.53757,2.45208],[41.53772,2.45222],[41.53784,2.45242],[41.53798,2.45263],[41.5381,2.45285],[41.53824,2.45306],[41.53839,2.45326],[41.53852,2.45348],[41.53867,2.45364],[41.53877,2.45388],[41.53876,2.45418],[41.53879,2.4544],[41.53894,2.45456],[41.53914,2.45494],[41.53927,2.45519],[41.53937,2.45536],[41.53953,2.45563],[41.53968,2.45591],[41.53985,2.45623],[41.53999,2.45646],[41.54007,2.45667],[41.54019,2.45669],[41.54052,2.45676],[41.54077,2.45687],[41.54096,2.4567],[41.541